--- !u!114 &1107805813549854856
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1399172659385316029}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 329f6646ba5779a4f86e7bd504f99feb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Rishi.FarmProgression
  steps:
  - goal:
      description: Collect 2 eggs
      resources:
      - White Egg
      - Brown Egg
      - Blue Egg
      - Red Egg
      - Golden Egg
      amount: 2
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn:
    - Hunger
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 8941879611330068566}
    - {fileID: 6917630446375140909}
    revealText: 'FEEDER UNLOCKED!

      Uh oh, your chickens get hungry now. Grab
      a feeder from Coop Depot, put it in the pen and toss hay bales in it'
  - goal:
      description: Collect 6 eggs
      resources:
      - White Egg
      - Brown Egg
      - Blue Egg
      - Red Egg
      - Golden Egg
      amount: 6
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn:
    - Thirst
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 8263525534521691826}
    - {fileID: 7016990563750188300}
    - {fileID: 7921868088608432231}
    revealText: 'WATER TROUGH UNLOCKED!

      Now they''re thirsty too. Dip the
      watering can in the well and tip it over the trough to pour'
  - goal:
      description: Collect 12 eggs
      resources:
      - White Egg
      - Brown Egg
      - Blue Egg
      - Red Egg
      - Golden Egg
      amount: 12
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn:
    - Warmth
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 6752734861538978288}
    - {fileID: 3713480209363519001}
    revealText: 'HEATER UNLOCKED!

      It''s getting cold out! The heater is basically
      a heat lamp, chickens near it warm up. Keep it running with fuel cans'
  - goal:
      description: Collect 20 eggs
      resources:
      - White Egg
      - Brown Egg
      - Blue Egg
      - Red Egg
      - Golden Egg
      amount: 20
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn: []
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 3896306668658557818}
    - {fileID: 5154177038465061137}
    - {fileID: 1648024561781976480}
    - {fileID: 4058834861146112689}
    - {fileID: 225524205919080756}
    - {fileID: 6075761843895851968}
    revealText: 'LIVESTOCK MARKET OPEN!

      You can buy more chickens at The Free
      Market now, or send one over to sell it. The McGlock is in stock too... if
      you need to cull the flock'
  - goal:
      description: Have 8 chickens
      resources:
      - Living Chicken
      amount: 8
      held: 1
    needsTurnedOn: []
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 1573902191001478259}
    - {fileID: 5730298229290298146}
    revealText: 'FEED DISTRIBUTER UNLOCKED!

      It''s like a mini silo. Put it
      next to a feeder and it refills it on its own with Leftovers or Chicken Feed'
  - goal:
      description: Collect 15 chicken poops
      resources:
      - Chicken Poop
      amount: 15
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn: []
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 7911888686288994054}
    revealText: 'WATER PUMP UNLOCKED!

      Put it next to a trough and it pumps
      water in by itself, no more running back and forth to the well'
  - goal:
      description: Collect 40 eggs
      resources:
      - White Egg
      - Brown Egg
      - Blue Egg
      - Red Egg
      - Golden Egg
      amount: 40
      held: 0
    needsTurnedOn: []
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 3653219718355503284}
    revealText: 'EGG COLLECTOR UNLOCKED!

      A magical basket that grabs eggs
      and poop around it for you. Stick it in the middle of the pen'
  - goal:
      description: Have 12 chickens
      resources:
      - Living Chicken
      amount: 12
      held: 1
    needsTurnedOn: []
    unlocks:
    - {fileID: 1547398408121041957}
    - {fileID: 3204542394428967195}
    revealText: 'FUEL DIVERTER UNLOCKED!

      A fuel tank for your heaters. Put
      it next to one and it burns Gasoline or Coal to keep it going. Coal is at the
      market now too'
  nextGoalBoard: {fileID: 6770884474005043464}
  nextGoalText: {fileID: 2400447541359331867}
  revealDelay: 3
  cardSeconds: 10
  unlockSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f03ad504602cf274bb09d0e36ccd8de7, type: 3}
  introText: Welcome to the chicken farm! Your chickens have just arrived and thankfully
    aren't super needy yet. Say hi to the little cluckers, and try picking up their
    eggs!
  lockedShelfText: Restocking soon!
